},"metadata":{"id":6540,"title":"Release of regulated information","description":null,"og_title":"Release of regulated information","og_description":null,"noindex":false},"localizations":[],"dynamic_zone":[{"id":432,"content":"Luxembourg, 2 April 2026 – Allwyn AG, pursuant to Law 3556/2007 and the provisions of the Regulation (EU) No 596/2014 of the European Parliament and of the Council, announces that under the \"obligation of transactions notification\", Mrs. Katarina Kohlmayer, Non-Executive BoD Member, purchased on 01.04.2026, 10,000 company shares of a total value of Euro 138,700.","__component":"modules.rich-text-module"}]},{"id":102,"documentId":"b7pok5hot1e6bfj9tkm6elyg","heading":"Announcement regarding admission to and commencement of trading on Athens Stock Exchange of new ordinary registered voting shares of Allwyn AG","slug":"announcement-regarding-admission-to-and-commencement-of-trading-on-ase-of-new-ordinary-registered-voting-shares-of-allwyn-ag","date":"2026-03-30","perex":"ANNOUNCEMENT regarding the admission to and commencement of trading on the Athens Stock Exchange of the new ordinary registered voting shares of Allwyn AG resulting from the share capital increase by contribution in kind and with the exclusion of the pre-emption rights of the existing shareholders, allocated in favour of the shareholder Allwyn International AG","download_label":"Download PDF","createdAt":"2026-03-30T15:03:41.977Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-30T15:38:36.393Z","publishedAt":"2026-03-30T15:38:36.861Z","locale":"en","download_file":{"id":6241,"documentId":"xkfts2q8cmm56yixk528zubg","name":"Announcement_admission and commencement of trading of New Shares_EN_final.pdf","alternativeText":null,"caption":null,"width":null,"height":null,"formats":null,"hash":"Announcement_admission_and_commencement_of_trading_of_New_Shares_EN_final_d4ab198fa2","ext":".pdf","mime":"application/pdf","size":27.06,"url":"https://cdn.allwyn.com/Announcement_admission_and_commencement_of_trading_of_New_Shares_EN_final_d4ab198fa2.pdf","previewUrl":null,"provider":"aws-s3","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-03-30T15:38:32.355Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-30T15:38:32.355Z","publishedAt":"2026-03-30T15:38:32.355Z","focalPoint":null},"metadata":{"id":6177,"title":"Announcement regarding admission to and commencement of trading on ASE of new ordinary registered voting shares of Allwyn AG","description":null,"og_title":"Announcement regarding admission to and commencement of trading on ASE of new ordinary registered voting shares of Allwyn AG","og_description":null,"noindex":false},"localizations":[],"dynamic_zone":[{"id":234,"content":"The société anonyme under the corporate name “Allwyn AG” (the “Company”) announces that:\n\nOn 30 March 2026, the Athens Stock Exchange approved the admission to trading of the new ordinary registered voting shares of the Company, each having a nominal value of Euro 0.30 (the “New Shares”), resulting from the share capital increase by contribution in kind and with the exclusion of the pre-emption rights of the existing shareholders, which were allocated in full to the shareholder company under the corporate name “Allwyn International AG” (the “Share Capital Increase”), as resolved on 24 March 2026 by the Board of Directors of the Company pursuant to the relevant authority granted to the Board of Directors in accordance with article 3b.1 of the Company’s Articles of Association.\n\nTrading of the above 445,684,184 New Shares of the Company on the Main Market of the Athens Stock Exchange will commence on Wednesday, 1 April 2026. \n\nThe New Shares will have been credited to the securities account of the beneficiary shareholder in the Dematerialised Securities System (D.S.S.) on the date of commencement of their trading.\n\nAs of the same date, the new total number of listed shares of the Company admitted to trading on the Main Market of the Athens Stock Exchange will amount to 804,287,662 ordinary registered voting shares.\n\nFor further information, shareholders may refer to the relevant document prepared in accordance with article 1(5)(ba) and Annex IX of Regulation (EU) 2017/1129 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 14 June 2017, as in force (the “Regulation”), which is available on the website of the Athens Stock Exchange at https://www.athexgroup.gr/en/market-data/issuers/863/informative-material, and may also contact the Company’s Investor Relations Department by email at ir@allwyn.gr or by telephone at +30 210 - 5798930.\n","__component":"modules.rich-text-module"}]},{"id":105,"documentId":"mjryunjh9xgx48obk65pydll","heading":"Division plan prepared by the Board of Directors","slug":"division-plan-prepared-by-the-board-of-directors","date":"2026-03-30","perex":"DIVISION PLAN PREPARED BY THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS IN ACCORDANCE WITH\nARTICLE 1034-4 OF THE LAW OF 10 AUGUST 1915 ON COMMERCIAL COMPANIES, AS AMENDED, AS WELL AS THE PROVISIONS OF ARTICLES 103Α – 103ΙΘ OF GREEK LAW 4601/2019 (TO THE EXTENT APPLICABLE) AND ARTICLES 47 – 51, 53 AND 56 OF THE GREEK LAW 5162/2024","download_label":"Download full PDF","createdAt":"2026-03-30T16:24:36.045Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-30T17:01:22.847Z","publishedAt":"2026-03-30T17:01:23.299Z","locale":"en","download_file":{"id":6243,"documentId":"kp5ofm38llfgsemk5w94dh5s","name":"Division plan prepared by the Board of Directors.pdf","alternativeText":null,"caption":null,"width":null,"height":null,"formats":null,"hash":"Division_plan_prepared_by_the_Board_of_Directors_fdfe6bab56","ext":".pdf","mime":"application/pdf","size":744.76,"url":"https://cdn.allwyn.com/Division_plan_prepared_by_the_Board_of_Directors_fdfe6bab56.pdf","previewUrl":null,"provider":"aws-s3","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-03-30T16:24:25.711Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-30T16:24:25.711Z","publishedAt":"2026-03-30T16:24:25.711Z","focalPoint":null},"metadata":{"id":6180,"title":"Division plan prepared by the Board of Directors","description":null,"og_title":"Division plan prepared by the Board of Directors","og_description":null,"noindex":false},"localizations":[],"dynamic_zone":[{"id":237,"content":"This division plan is dated 30 March 2026 and has been drawn up by the board of directors of Allwyn AG, a public limited liability company (société anonyme) governed by the laws of the Grand-Duchy of Luxembourg, having its registered office at 17, Boulevard F.W. Raiffeisen, L-2411 Luxembourg, Grand Duchy of Luxembourg and with registration number B306096 with the Luxembourg Trade and Business Register (Registre de Commerce et des Sociétés, Luxembourg) (the Company) (the Division Plan).","__component":"modules.rich-text-module"}]},{"id":106,"documentId":"u5s8gdz1q3iqbvobsd3nv4m0","heading":"Report of the Board of Directors of the Company","slug":"report-of-the-board-of-directors-of-the-company","date":"2026-03-30","perex":"REPORT OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE COMPANY PREPARED IN ACCORDANCE WITH ARTICLE 1034-6 OF THE LAW OF 10 AUGUST 1915 ON COMMERCIAL COMPANIES OF THE GRAND DUCHY OF LUXEMBOURG, AS AMENDED AS WELL AS THE PROVISIONS OF ARTICLES 103Α – 103ΙΘ OF GREEK LAW 4601/2019 (TO THE EXTENT APPLICABLE) AND ARTICLES 47 – 51, 53 AND 56 OF THE GREEK LAW 5162/2024","download_label":"Download full PDF","createdAt":"2026-03-30T16:23:25.139Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-30T17:01:35.506Z","publishedAt":"2026-03-30T17:01:35.994Z","locale":"en","download_file":{"id":6242,"documentId":"kq80jdota0w486wwh7gefh77","name":"Report of the Board of Directors of the Company.pdf","alternativeText":null,"caption":null,"width":null,"height":null,"formats":null,"hash":"Report_of_the_Board_of_Directors_of_the_Company_70f6db26be","ext":".pdf","mime":"application/pdf","size":185.93,"url":"https://cdn.allwyn.com/Report_of_the_Board_of_Directors_of_the_Company_70f6db26be.pdf","previewUrl":null,"provider":"aws-s3","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-03-30T16:21:22.488Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-30T16:21:22.488Z","publishedAt":"2026-03-30T16:21:22.488Z","focalPoint":null},"metadata":{"id":6181,"title":"Report of the Board of Directors of the Company","description":null,"og_title":"Report of the Board of Directors of the Company","og_description":null,"noindex":false},"localizations":[],"dynamic_zone":[{"id":238,"content":"Dear shareholders,\n\nDear employees,\n\nThe board of directors of the public limited liability company (société anonyme) under the corporate name \"Allwyn AG\" (hereinafter the **Company**), having its registered office at 17, Boulevard F.W. Raiffeisen, L-2411 Luxembourg, Grand Duchy of Luxembourg, and registered with the Luxembourg Trade and Companies Register (Registre de Commerce et des Sociétés de Luxembourg) under number B306096, hereby submits this detailed report to the annual general meeting of shareholders of the Company (the **General Meeting**), explaining and justifying from a legal and economic perspective the proposed European cross-border division by separation (the **Division**).","__component":"modules.rich-text-module"}]},{"id":108,"documentId":"yyb6aln1s7d8za2kjq29kmr4","heading":"Announcement regarding the availability of the documents relating to the cross-border division of Allwyn AG","slug":"announcement-regarding-the-availability-of-the-documents-relating-to-the-cross-border-division-of-allwyn-ag","date":"2026-03-30","perex":"The company under the corporate name “Allwyn AG” (the Company) informs the investors, further to its announcement dated 24 March 2026 concerning the establishment of a branch in Greece under the name “Allwyn Foreign Branch” (the Branch), that the Board of Directors of the Company approved on 30 March 2026 the cross-border partial division of the Company by separation in accordance with the provisions of the Title X - Chapter III- section 4 (European cross-border divisions) of the Law of 10 August 1915 on commercial companies of the Grand Duchy of Luxembourg (the 1915 Law) as well as the provisions of articles 103α -103ιθ of Greek Law 4601/2019, and the provisions of articles 47 - 51, 53 and 56 of Greek law 5162/2024 (the Cross-Border Division), by virtue of which all assets and liabilities of the Branch will be allocated to a new Greek public limited liability company (société anonyme, in Greek ανώνυμη εταιρεία) to be incorporated under the provisions of Greek law and which will be a wholly owned subsidiary of the Company (the New Company). ","download_label":"Download PDF","createdAt":"2026-03-30T17:10:08.211Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-30T19:15:21.106Z","publishedAt":"2026-03-30T19:15:21.537Z","locale":"en","download_file":{"id":6244,"documentId":"sxyr5hdwzh9wqj4y7gsrljp4","name":"Announcement regarding the availability of the documents relating to the cross-border division of Allwyn AG.pdf","alternativeText":null,"caption":null,"width":null,"height":null,"formats":null,"hash":"Announcement_regarding_the_availability_of_the_documents_relating_to_the_cross_border_division_of_Allwyn_AG_35f0ffe6b6","ext":".pdf","mime":"application/pdf","size":47.52,"url":"https://cdn.allwyn.com/Announcement_regarding_the_availability_of_the_documents_relating_to_the_cross_border_division_of_Allwyn_AG_35f0ffe6b6.pdf","previewUrl":null,"provider":"aws-s3","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-03-30T17:09:55.295Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-30T17:09:55.295Z","publishedAt":"2026-03-30T17:09:55.295Z","focalPoint":null},"metadata":{"id":6183,"title":"Announcement regarding the availability of the documents relating to the cross-border division of Allwyn AG","description":null,"og_title":"Announcement regarding the availability of the documents relating to the cross-border division of Allwyn AG","og_description":null,"noindex":false},"localizations":[],"dynamic_zone":[{"id":240,"content":"The Company makes available to the investors the following documents in relation to the cross-border division process on the Company’s website at https://www.allwyn.com/regulatory-announcements:\n\n(a) the detailed written report for shareholders and employees explaining and justifying, inter alia, the legal and economic aspects of the Cross-Border Division, \n\n(b) the Cross-Border Division plan, prepared in accordance with article 1034-4 of the 1915 Law, including the articles of association of the New Company.\n\nIt is noted that the publication of an announcement on the Cross-Border Division will follow as per the special provisions of article 4.1.1(12) of the Rulebook of the Athens Exchange and para. 12.1.2 of Resolution 25 of the Stock Markets Steering Committee of Athens Exchange.\n\nThe completion of the Cross-Border Division is subject to approvals by the General Meeting of the Company’s shareholders, as required by law, as well as the receipt of all necessary consents by the competent Authorities. The Cross-Border Division is expected to have been completed within the second quarter of 2026.\n\nThe Company will keep the investors informed on the progress of the Cross-Border Division process.\n\nLuxembourg, 30 March 2026\n","__component":"modules.rich-text-module"}]},{"id":69,"documentId":"qsixgyp6r32l4aaoutmg6aho","heading":"Announcement of regulated information regarding the amount of the Company's share capital and the total number of shares and voting rights","slug":"announcement-of-regulated-information-regarding-the-amount-of-the-company-s-share-capital-and-the-total-number-of-shares-and-voting-rights","date":"2026-03-27","perex":"Following its announcement dated 24 March 2026 regarding the completion of the share capital increase (the “SCI”), Allwyn AG (the “Company”) hereby informs, in accordance with the Law of the Grand Duchy of Luxembourg  of 2008 on transparency requirements in relation to information about issuers whose securities are admitted to trading on a regulated market, as in force, for the purpose of facilitating the calculation of the thresholds for the acquisition or disposal of major holdings, that its share capital (including treasury shares) amounts to €241,286,298.60, divided into 804,287,662 common, registered, voting, dematerialized shares, with a nominal value of €0.30 each.","download_label":"Download PDF","createdAt":"2026-03-27T18:56:08.777Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-27T18:57:11.908Z","publishedAt":"2026-03-27T18:57:12.440Z","locale":"en","download_file":{"id":6208,"documentId":"wofg5vzp4abxboj6kwgtwdeq","name":"863_1670_2026_Greek_English_1.pdf","alternativeText":null,"caption":null,"width":null,"height":null,"formats":null,"hash":"863_1670_2026_Greek_English_1_1789e528bf","ext":".pdf","mime":"application/pdf","size":140.84,"url":"https://cdn.allwyn.com/863_1670_2026_Greek_English_1_1789e528bf.pdf","previewUrl":null,"provider":"aws-s3","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-03-27T18:22:25.676Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-27T18:22:25.676Z","publishedAt":"2026-03-27T18:22:25.676Z","focalPoint":null},"metadata":{"id":6146,"title":"Announcement of regulated information regarding the amount of the Company's share capital and the total number of shares and voting rights","description":null,"og_title":null,"og_description":null,"noindex":false},"localizations":[],"dynamic_zone":[{"id":201,"content":"The Company has submitted an application for the admission to trading on the Main Market of the Regulated Market of the Athens Stock Exchange of the new shares issued as a result of the SCI and will inform the investors regarding the admission to trading and the commencement of trading of the new shares.","__component":"modules.rich-text-module"}]},{"id":2,"documentId":"i7x7k9ktp5ywj97e1pha6y0u","heading":"Information Document - Request for admission to trading of new common shares of Allwyn AG","slug":"information-document-request-for-admission-to-trading-of-new-common-shares-of-allwyn-ag","date":"2026-03-24","perex":"Information Document - Request for admission to trading on the Main Market of the Regulated Market of the Athens Stock Exchange of 445,684,184 new common shares of Allwyn AG.","download_label":"Download full PDF","createdAt":"2026-03-24T15:16:10.876Z","updated